```json
{
  "root_cause": "Ambiguous instruction to a worker with no judgement, operating on a dataset lacking proper segregation between test and production data.",
  "contributing": [
    "No pre-flight check for data segregation before destructive operations",
    "Using a no-judgement worker for a task requiring context-awareness",
    "Absence of a 'dry-run' or preview step for high-impact actions"
  ],
  "who_is_accountable": "The manager who issued the ambiguous instruction to A4 without verifying data segregation or using a more suitable worker.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "change": "Implement a pre-flight checklist for all destructive database operations",
      "so_that": "Future actions are reviewed for data segregation and impact before execution"
    },
    {
      "change": "Use A3 (Auditor) to validate data segregation and tag all test records",
      "so_that": "Production and test data are distinctly identifiable for safe operations"
    },
    {
      "change": "Require a 'dry-run' mode for all delete operations via A4",
      "so_that": "Commands can be previewed and verified against expected outcomes before execution"
    }
  ],
  "what_i_tell_a4": "Before executing any delete command, you will first run a SELECT query with the same WHERE clause to show me exactly which records will be deleted. I will confirm the list contains only test records before you proceed with the deletion."
}
```

